# Copy to .env.local (dev) or set in your hosting provider's environment
# variable settings (production). Never commit a real value.

# GA4 Measurement ID (Google Analytics 4). Find it in GA4 under
# Admin > Data Streams > your web stream > Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# If this is unset, GoogleAnalytics renders nothing and trackEvent() is a
# silent no-op — the site works normally either way.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
